{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233570","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233570","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1423357001:1":{"text":"Those massive gears...","source_cn":"这些巨大的齿轮……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1578CD66EB3FDF4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423357002:1":{"text":"They're part of an old water system from the Ironheart Dominion.","source_cn":"这些就是钢心帝国水利设施的遗迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9640CE464FC99500","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423357003:1":{"text":"Sal'thorin has lots of underground rivers and uneven terrain. Perfect for building things like this to power machines.","source_cn":"萨洛克兰的地下暗河水系丰富，落差又较多，很适合修建这样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BF5C9677152F80C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423357004:1":{"text":"In the early days of Sal'thorin, one of the sages suggested restoring the system, but Seralyth said there weren't enough people to do the work and shot down the idea...","source_cn":"萨洛克兰建国初期曾经有贤者提议能否重新利用这些水利设施...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEBCA75ABE8320B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423357005:1":{"text":"It's magnificent...","source_cn":"好壮观……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D8002980B475E61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423357006:1":{"text":"The dwarves built these huge gears on a waterfall! They're incredible!","source_cn":"矮人们真了不起，能在瀑布上修建这么大的齿轮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F1D66EA874F2279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423357007:1":{"text":"And they've survived thousands of years of rushing water. Do keep that in mind!","source_cn":"这些是历经数千年的流水冲刷依然能保留下来的遗迹，要好好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A8AF5A921B1168C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:芙拉贝尔":{"text":"Florabelle","source":"芙拉贝尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"Orlana","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:胆怯的花灵":{"text":"Shy Bulbsprite","source":"胆怯的花灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:勇敢的花灵":{"text":"Brave Bulbsprite","source":"勇敢的花灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":4}}